# Why Use Pagination?

- fast APIs
- less server load
- less bandwidth
- scalable APIs
- better frontend performance

---

# Production Usage

| Pagination Type | Use |
|---|---|
| PageNumberPagination | simple apps |
| LimitOffsetPagination | SQL style APIs |
| CursorPagination | large scalable apps |

